{
  "title": "Forward deployed engineers plan",
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "overview",
      "title": "Overview",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": [
            "The Forward Deployed Engineers plan aims to accelerate digital delivery by providing short-term, on-demand, hands-on technical resources to digital teams, helping them solve complex problems which require extra skills or capacity."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": [
            "It was created in response to support requests from digital teams and Deputy Directors, and is currently at the ",
            {
              "type": "bold",
              "text": "Experiment"
            },
            " stage."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "use-cases",
      "title": "Use cases",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "subsection",
          "heading": "Skill gaps",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": [
                "Helping to solve short term problems/improve implementation where product teams don't have a short-term requirement for a particular skill-set (DevOps is a good example)."
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "subsection",
          "heading": "Platform and capability adoption",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": ["Helping teams consume internal capabilities effectively."]
            },
            {
              "type": "list",
              "items": [
                "strategic hosting adoption",
                "DevOps maturity improvements",
                "observability implementation"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "subsection",
          "heading": "Discovery and experimentation",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": [
                "Requirements for hands-on technical staff that aren't currently on the team."
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": ["Examples include"]
            },
            {
              "type": "list",
              "items": [
                "prototyping an idea before committing funding",
                "technical feasibility assessment",
                "Proof of Concept (PoC)",
                "spikes to reduce uncertainty around a delivery approach",
                "evaluating \"buy vs. build\" decisions"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "subsection",
          "heading": "Critical problem resolution",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "list",
              "items": [
                "skilled engineers engaged to solve difficult problems",
                "major production incidents",
                "chronic service instability",
                "system performance bottlenecks",
                "scalability issues",
                "technical debt blocking delivery",
                "security vulnerabilities requiring rapid remediation"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "subsection",
          "heading": "High-risk delivery support",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": [
                "When teams need extra capacity to hit a critical deadline (e.g. regulatory/compliance deadlines government commitments). The maximum project time should be 6 months."
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": [
                {
                  "type": "bold",
                  "text": "Important:"
                },
                " This approach is not to be used for filling general resource gaps in teams."
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "initial-resource-profile",
      "title": "Initial resourcing profile",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": [
            "All engineers will be hands on technical engineers who will write code and support teams, not management engineers."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "subsection",
          "heading": "Software engineering",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "list",
              "items": ["Principal Developer", "Senior Developer"]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "subsection",
          "heading": "DevOps engineering",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "list",
              "items": ["Principal DevOps", "Senior DevOps"]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
